{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Snap2Gif 是一款將影片轉換成 GIF 動畫的工具，讓用戶可以輕鬆分享搞笑片段或重溫重要時刻，不必再為格式轉換煩惱。無論是喜歡在 iMessage 傳送趣味貼圖，還是習慣在社交平台發佈動畫內容，這款 App 都相當適合；目前正限時免費，原價 US $1.99。</p>\n\n<h2>實用功能快速上手</h2>\n<p>這款 App 讓用戶從相簿選取最多 15 秒影片，再按需要調整縮放比例、幀率與像素格式，輸出色彩經過優化的 GIF。它亦支援流暢的循環播放，讓每個有趣瞬間都能不斷重播；完成後可以直接分享至 iMessage、社交平台及即時通訊 App，無論日常聊天還是社交貼文都很適合使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1179x2556bb-6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1179x2556bb-7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1179x2556bb-8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1179x2556bb-9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1179x2556bb-10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1179x2556bb-11.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Snap2Gif</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T08:40:43.507697+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}